# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

.DS_Store

proof_tree.bin
proof_tree.bin.tt

# Working layer of the proofdb initiative: all generated proofdb state
# (shard set + manifest under data/proofdb/shards/, the derived proof DB
# rebuilt from it at any time, and the harvest sidecar work ledger —
# plan14 centralized the defaults there). Supersedes the nn-era
# data/corpus and data/oracle entries; the archive itself lives on the
# nn branch. Backing up data/proofdb/shards/ is the operator's
# responsibility (manual §2.1).
data/

# Raw measurement run data: solver run transcripts (.out/.err/.log/.time,
# captured stdout/stderr, superseded by the parsed results in
# measurements/*/state/*.json) and empty TT-snapshot tombstones
# (*.tt.keep). Summaries live in the per-plan measurements/*/README.md;
# the drivers + env.json + parsed results are committed. See the
# measurement-data convention in AGENTS.md; commit exceptions via
# `git add -f`.
docs/plans/**/measurements/**/logs/
docs/plans/**/measurements/**/*.log
docs/plans/**/measurements/**/*.out
docs/plans/**/measurements/**/*.err
docs/plans/**/measurements/**/*.time
*.tt.keep
